        {
          "id": "2fcddf68-183c-3a45-a69d-8d079ce01d7d",
          "content": {
            "id": "2fcddf68-183c-3a45-a69d-8d079ce01d7d",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Nokia Bulls Delight as Nvidia Deal Fuels Europe\u2019s Latest AI Play",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "The stock is poised for its steepest weekly gain since January 2024, capping its best month since 2013, after Nvidia Corp. agreed to take a $1 billion equity stake in the Finnish company.  Nvidia\u2019s chips will also be used to accelerate Nokia\u2019s software for the current 5G and next-generation 6G networks.  It\u2019s something of a turnaround after years of struggle for Nokia, as the rollout of 5G networks proved to be slow and underwhelming.",
